#### 5. Alternative: Debug with a Custom Interceptor
If logs still show `[FILTERED]`, intercept the HTTP request/response manually:

```java
import com.azure.core.http.HttpClient;
import com.azure.core.http.netty.NettyAsyncHttpClientBuilder;
import com.azure.core.http.policy.HttpPipelinePolicy;
import com.azure.core.http.HttpRequest;
import com.azure.core.http.HttpResponse;
import reactor.core.publisher.Mono;

public class LoggingPolicy implements HttpPipelinePolicy {
    @Override
    public Mono<HttpResponse> process(HttpPipelineCallContext context, HttpPipelineNextPolicy next) {
        HttpRequest request = context.getHttpRequest();
        System.out.println("Request URL: " + request.getUrl());
        System.out.println("Request Body: " + request.getBodyAsString().block());

        return next.process().map(response -> {
            System.out.println("Response Status: " + response.getStatusCode());
            System.out.println("Response Body: " + response.getBodyAsString().block());
            return response;
        });
    }
}

@Configuration
public class AzureOpenAIConfig {
    @Bean
    public OpenAIClient openAIClient(TokenCredential tokenCredential) {
        HttpClient httpClient = new NettyAsyncHttpClientBuilder().build();
        HttpPipeline pipeline = new HttpPipelineBuilder()
                .httpClient(httpClient)
                .policies(new LoggingPolicy()) // Add custom logging policy
                .build();

        return new OpenAIClientBuilder()
                .endpoint("https://your-resource-name.openai.azure.com/")
                .pipeline(pipeline)
                .credential(tokenCredential)
                .buildClient();
    }
}
```

- **Output**: Prints to `System.out`, bypassing Logback filtering.

---

### Notes
- **Performance**: Logging full bodies can generate large outputs, so use this for debugging only.
- **Security**: Avoid logging in production if sensitive data (e.g., tokens) is included unless redacted.
- **Dependencies**: Ensure you have:
  ```groovy
  implementation 'com.azure:azure-ai-openai:1.0.0-beta.6'
  implementation 'io.projectreactor.netty:reactor-netty-http:1.1.15' // Or compatible version
  ```

